WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.455
A figure to find.

00:02.155 --> 00:07.956
The lines join stars into the figures people have told stories about for thousands of years.

00:08.406 --> 00:13.633
Learn one and you can find the next from it, the way you learn a town from one street.

00:14.083 --> 00:18.037
The line below names the one that is best placed for you right now.
